OL,3,GNEWSASevere weather warning issued
OL,4,Aahead of potential UK storm later this
OL,5,Aweek
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK may see its first named storm of
OL,8,Fthe autumn as forecasts show the
OL,9,Fpotential for a deep area of low
OL,10,Fpressure to cross the UK later this
OL,11,Fweek.
OL,13,FA yellow severe weather warning has
OL,14,Fbeen issued by the Met Office for
OL,15,FFriday in south-western parts of the
OL,16,FUK.
OL,18,FStrong winds, with gusts as high as
OL,19,F70mph, are possible in the worst
OL,20,Faffected areas.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
