OL,3,GNEWSASevere weather warning issued
OL,4,Aahead of potential UK storm later this
OL,5,Aweek
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe whole of the UK will experience
OL,8,Frain at times, including places
OL,9,Fcurrently in drought, but amounts will
OL,10,Fdepend on the exact track of a stormy
OL,11,Flow pressure system from late Thursday.
